DATA LICENSING NOTICE

The aggregated dataset published by this site (see /export/all.csv and
/export/all.json) is derived from public-domain U.S. federal government
sources:

  - USAspending.gov  (https://api.usaspending.gov/)  — public domain (17 USC §105)
  - SAM.gov         (https://sam.gov/data-services) — public domain, subject to SAM.gov API ToS

The derived dataset is offered under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal
public-domain dedication: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

You may use, redistribute, and build commercial products on top of the data
without attribution. Attribution to GovAI Contracts is appreciated but not
required.
